Content-Type: application/json

{
    "CI": "27",
    "lastName":"Guzmannnnnnn",
    "name":"hola",
    "cellphone":"12345",
    "address":"casa1, calle2",
    "salary":900.00,
    "RIF":"J-00112233-4"
}

###borrar un empledo | listo 
